WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:08.850
Married women were originally banned from
watching the Olympic Games in ancient Greece.

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:12.490
If they did, they were promptly thrown off
a cliff.

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:19.410
Welcome to RIF

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:25.740
For decades the National Oceanic and Atmospheric
Administration have been tracking a single

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:30.660
mysterious whale that speaks its own language.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:34.859
It sings at a frequency that no other whale
transmits at.

00:00:34.859 --> 00:00:38.929
It has been called "the world's loneliest
whale".

00:00:38.929 --> 00:00:45.359
In South Korea two barber's poles next to
each spinning in opposite directions are used

00:00:45.359 --> 00:00:47.989
to signify a brothel.

00:00:47.989 --> 00:00:54.069
The anti-piracy group BREIN, who are responsible
for putting the anti-piracy ad on all your

00:00:54.069 --> 00:00:58.670
DVDs was sued for stealing the theme song.

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:06.870
During World War 2, a U.S. soldier named Dirk
J. Vlug was ambushed by 5 Japanese tanks.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:13.570
He single-handedly destroyed all 5 and was
eventually awarded the Medal of Honour.

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:19.530
In the Dark ages up to the 1800s animals were
sentenced for human crimes.

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:26.670
Dogs, pigs, cows, rats and even flies and
caterpillars were prosecuted in court on charges

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:29.100
ranging from murder to obscenity.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:33.259
At birth, babies don't have kneecaps.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:38.460
Kneecaps do not develop completely until after
six months.

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:44.079
After a male penguin falls in love, he will
search the entire beach to find the perfect

00:01:44.079 --> 00:01:46.670
pebble to give to her.

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:53.539
The average American eats an amount of fat
equivalent to one whole stick of butter each

00:01:53.539 --> 00:01:54.759
day.

00:01:54.759 --> 00:02:00.619
For every human killed by a shark, humans
kill two million sharks.

00:02:00.619 --> 00:02:07.530
And finally if a person yelled for 8 years,
7 months, and 6 days, he or she would produce

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:26.280
enough energy to heat just one cup of coffee.

